therock: therock (The HIP Environment and ROCm Kit)
therock:
therock: TheRock is the open source build and release system for HIP and ROCm,
therock: integrating ROCm's components into a single buildable, testable, and
therock: releasable product. Since ROCm 7.14, ROCm is built and released
therock: through TheRock.
therock:
therock: This package installs a GPU-family-targeted ROCm distribution under
therock: /opt/rocm. Built for: default gfx120X-dgpu (override via GPU_FAMILIES).
